@startuml
title Dispute & Refund Process (Wallet / Service Transactions Only)

|Student|
start
:Log in and open wallet transaction history;
:Select a transaction related to services
(e.g. canteen, library, parking, top-up);
:Click "Report / Dispute this transaction";
:Enter description and submit dispute;

|Wallet System|
:Create dispute record with status = "NEW";
:Link dispute to the selected wallet transaction;
:Notify Finance / Support dashboard of new dispute;

|Finance / Accounting|
:Open "Disputes" screen;
:Review disputed transaction details
(type: SERVICE_PAYMENT or TOPUP, not tuition);
:Review related wallet logs, POS logs,
internal service info (library/parking), etc.;

if (Dispute valid?) then (yes)
  :Decide refund or adjustment amount;
  :Execute refund/adjustment using
  internal finance process (cash/bank transfer etc.);
  |Wallet System|
  :Record refund/adjustment transaction
  (type = SERVICE_REFUND / TOPUP_ADJUSTMENT);
  :Update dispute status = "RESOLVED - REFUNDED";
else (no)
  |Wallet System|
  :Update dispute status = "REJECTED";
endif

|Wallet System|
:Notify student about dispute result
(resolved/refunded or rejected);

|Student|
:View dispute status and any refund
on wallet transaction history;
stop
@enduml
